---

Recent Security Updates

This project has been updated to address security concerns:
- Removed insecure SSL certificate bypass that was making TLS connections vulnerable
- Implemented proper SSL certificate validation for all production connections
- Enhanced environment variable handling for improved security posture

---

PiNet Integration

This application is fully configured for PiNet integration:
- PiNet metadata endpoint at `/api/pinet/meta`
- Support for social sharing with Open Graph and Twitter Cards
- Accessible via PiNet URLs for both Pioneer and non-Pioneer users
- Proper trademark compliance with Pi Network guidelines